[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
Velocidade de construção de §Yinstalações navais§!

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de construção de instalações navais.

[l_braz_por.naval_facility]
Instalação de engenharia naval

[l_braz_por.naval_facility_desc]
As instalações experimentais de engenharia naval permitem iniciar projetos de pesquisa relacionados a navios de superfície e submarinos.
Uma instalação de engenharia naval só pode ser criada em uma província costeira.

[l_braz_por.naval_facility_plural]
Instalações de engenharia naval

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
§YNaval Facility§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Naval Facility construction.

[l_english.naval_facility]
Naval Engineering Facility

[l_english.naval_facility_desc]
Experimental Facilities for Naval Engineering allow you to start research projects related to Surface Ships and Submarines.
A Naval Engineering Facility can only be created in a coastal province.

[l_english.naval_facility_plural]
Naval Engineering Facilities

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
Vit. de constr. des bâtiments navals 

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction des bâtiments navals.

[l_french.naval_facility]
Bâtiment d'ingénierie navale

[l_french.naval_facility_desc]
Les installations expérimentales d'ingénierie navale permettent de lancer des projets de recherche liés aux navires et aux sous-marins.
Ce bâtiment ne peut être construit que dans une province littorale.

[l_french.naval_facility_plural]
Bâtiments d'ingénierie navale

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit §Y(Marinestandorte)§!

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für alle Marinestandorte.

[l_german.naval_facility]
Standort für Schiffsbautechnik

[l_german.naval_facility_desc]
Dieser Standort für Schiffsbautechnik kann Forschungsprojekte für Überwasserschiffe und U-Boote durchführen.
Ein Standort für Schiffsbautechnik kann nur in einer Küstenprovinz geschaffen werden.

[l_german.naval_facility_plural]
Standorte für Schiffsbautechnik

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
§Y海軍施設§!建設速度

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
海軍施設の建設速度を補正する。

[l_japanese.naval_facility]
海軍技術研究施設

[l_japanese.naval_facility_desc]
海軍技術の実験施設では、水上艦や潜水艦に関する研究計画を開始することができる。
海軍技術施設は沿岸の地域にしか創設できない。

[l_japanese.naval_facility_plural]
海軍技術研究施設

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
§Y해군 시설§! 건설 속도

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
해군 시설 건설 속도 변동치

[l_korean.naval_facility]
조선공학 연구소

[l_korean.naval_facility_desc]
해군 공학 실험 시설을 확보하면 수상함과 잠수함에 관련된 연구 프로젝트를 시작할 수 있습니다.
해군 공학 시설은 해안 지역에만 건설할 수 있습니다.

[l_korean.naval_facility_plural]
조선공학 연구소

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
Tempo budowy §Yplacówki morskiej§!

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
Zmienia tempo budowy placówki morskiej.

[l_polish.naval_facility]
Ośrodek inżynierii morskiej

[l_polish.naval_facility_desc]
Eksperymentalne ośrodki inżynierii morskiej pozwalają uruchomić projekty badawcze związane z okrętami nawodnymi i podwodnymi.
Placówkę inżynierii morskiej można stworzyć tylko w prowincji nadmorskiej.

[l_polish.naval_facility_plural]
Ośrodki inżynierii morskiej

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
Скорость строительства §Yморского объекта§!

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
Изменяет скорость строительства морского объекта.

[l_russian.naval_facility]
Институт военно-морской техники

[l_russian.naval_facility_desc]
Экспериментальные институты военно-морской техники позволяют запускать проекты по разработке надводных кораблей и подлодок.
Создать такой институт можно только в прибрежной провинции.

[l_russian.naval_facility_plural]
Институты военно-морской техники

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
§Y海上设施§!建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
改变海上设施的建设速度。

[l_simp_chinese.naval_facility]
海军工程设施

[l_simp_chinese.naval_facility_desc]
海军工程设施允许你启动与水面舰艇和潜艇相关的研究项目。
海军工程设施只能在沿海省份建造。

[l_simp_chinese.naval_facility_plural]
海军工程设施

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor]
Velocidad de construcción de §Yinstalaciones navales§!

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_naval_facility_factor_desc]
Modifica la velocidad de construcción de instalaciones navales.

[l_spanish.naval_facility]
Instalación de ingeniería naval

[l_spanish.naval_facility_desc]
Las instalaciones experimentales de ingeniería naval te permiten iniciar proyectos de investigación relacionados con barcos de superficie y submarinos.
Solo se puede crear una instalación de ingeniería naval en una provincia costera.

[l_spanish.naval_facility_plural]
Instalaciones de ingeniería naval

